  designNotes: 'Beat 11: the exam. The chart offers a helicopter here OR a focus-fire
    test; HELI_ENABLED is false for camera-load reasons that are a real problem rather
    than a stale flag, so this is the skill version. Rocket troopers and heavies
    on one post: everything is either fragile-and-dangerous or tough-and-slow, and
    the player has to sort them under a turn limit of their own patience. Was a 6v6
    stub with no payout that broke the locked 7-30 roster scale.'
